  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: 'Ledger: the steward'
  Body: 'BLOOD LEDGER / THE STEWARD


    Every midnight the chapel bell rings with
    no hand on the rope, and every midnight one of us is written out of the book.


    I
    hid the silver blade where he cannot bear to look: in the reliquary box below,
    under the marks his own claws left. Light the ash and you will see it.'
